-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SD card / SD mode / Zynq-7020
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is a set of example captures of SD cards in "SD mode" (not SPI mode).

The cards were used in an eval board based on the Zylinx Zynq-7020.
The card was a Swissbit Series S-600 card.

Details:
https://www.amd.com/en/products/adaptive-socs-and-fpgas/soc/zynq-7000.html
https://www.swissbit.com/data/S-600/S-600_fact_sheet.pdf


Logic analyzer setup
--------------------

The logic analyzer used was a Kingst LA-5016 (at 50MHz):

  Probe       SD card
  -------------------
  0           DAT0
  1           DAT1
  2           CMD
  3           DAT2
  4           DAT3
  5           CLK

